      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Valley_Ford%2C_California"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Watson School served Valley Ford from 1856 to 1967; today it sits in a historic park 3.5 miles north of town.",
